show.help=§7[Tip] Type §6/chelp§r§7 in chat to see available commands.
help=§s--------------- §bHELP §3---------------\n §e/chelp §f｜ Displays the list of available commands.\n §e/rule §f｜ Shows the game description and rules.\n §e/team §f｜ Shows your team members.\n §e/team all §f｜ Shows all team rosters.\n §e/ptp §f｜ Teleports to the specified player. ( §7Spectators only§r )\n§3------------------------------------
rule=§6--------------------- §pGame Description & Rules §6---------------------§f\n1. After voting for difficulty, players are randomly assigned to teams. Defeat all enemy teams to win.\n2. If you die, you become a ghost and can continue helping your team.\n3. If you leave the game and do not return within 5 minutes, you will be automatically eliminated.\nDisruptive behavior may result in warnings or bans by the admins. Once you join, please stay committed until the end.\n§6----------------------------------

